WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.588 --> 00:00:05.710
"Oh no!"

2
00:00:15.778 --> 00:00:16.458
Roxy cried.

3
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:18.880
Groon was shaking.

4
00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:24.344
Old spaceships and other metal objects broke apart and floated up into the sky.

5
00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.427
The ground itself began to break apart.

6
00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:33.458
"Whoa!" Terrell jumped to avoid getting hit by a rusty barrel.

7
00:00:34.599 --> 00:00:35.559
Cozlin looked ill.

8
00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:37.440
"Did Dr.

9
00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:39.262
Odd really leave us?

10
00:00:40.122 --> 00:00:44.765
We can't get home—or anywhere—without him!"

11
00:00:45.486 --> 00:00:46.386
Wukong gulped.

12
00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:49.108
"This is bad."

13
00:00:50.609 --> 00:00:52.531
A million thoughts ran through Roxy's head.

14
00:00:52.551 --> 00:00:57.154
"This planet is falling apart," she thought.

15
00:00:57.174 --> 00:01:00.456
"I'll be trapped here, floating in outer space!

16
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.001
And worse than that—I brought Terrell here!

17
00:01:04.402 --> 00:01:05.242
And Wukong!

18
00:01:06.503 --> 00:01:09.284
They'll be stuck here, millions of light-years from home!

19
00:01:10.405 --> 00:01:11.906
And it's all my fault!"

20
00:01:13.747 --> 00:01:16.128
But the thing that bothered Roxy the most was Dr.

21
00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:19.430
Odd. "I shouldn't have trusted him!"

22
00:01:19.891 --> 00:01:20.391
she thought.

23
00:01:22.892 --> 00:01:25.054
Suddenly a spaceship appeared just above them.

24
00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:28.556
A hatch opened, revealing a figure inside.

25
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:30.881
"Dr. Odd!"

26
00:01:31.321 --> 00:01:32.021
Roxy cried.

27
00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:33.843
"Get in!"

28
00:01:34.263 --> 00:01:34.783
he shouted.

29
00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:39.386
"Quickly!" Everyone jumped into the spaceship.

30
00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:45.130
Dr. Odd grabbed the controls and flew up into space.

31
00:01:48.512 --> 00:01:51.434
"You probably thought I left you behind," Dr.

32
00:01:51.494 --> 00:01:51.935
Odd said.

33
00:01:51.955 --> 00:01:56.498
"The magnetic field went down, and my moon drifted off Groon.

34
00:01:57.358 --> 00:01:59.480
The planet's orbit is filled with debris.

35
00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.982
It took me a while to navigate back down to the surface."

36
00:02:06.763 --> 00:02:09.384
He flew past pieces of old rockets and satellites.

37
00:02:11.585 --> 00:02:16.467
Soon they were all back inside the moon.

38
00:02:17.748 --> 00:02:19.909
They sat in an observation room, and Dr.

39
00:02:20.009 --> 00:02:21.530
Odd brought out tea and snacks.

40
00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:30.204
Through a large window, they watched as more objects drifted away from Groon.

41
00:02:30.224 --> 00:02:31.424
Cozlin made a call to Delkor.

42
00:02:33.225 --> 00:02:35.085
She breathed a huge sigh of relief.

43
00:02:39.207 --> 00:02:40.067
news, everyone.

44
00:02:40.687 --> 00:02:43.268
All the robots on Delkor stopped working.

45
00:02:43.748 --> 00:02:45.168
My planet is safe."

46
00:02:48.149 --> 00:02:51.310
Roxy called Mayor Bloom and found out that Metro City was also safe.

47
00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:55.551
"What about that huge demon?"

48
00:02:55.951 --> 00:02:56.791
Wukong asked.

49
00:02:56.811 --> 00:02:58.972
"You mean Meltron?"

50
00:02:59.264 --> 00:03:00.044
Cozlin said.

51
00:03:00.064 --> 00:03:02.905
"He's a robot, not a demon.

52
00:03:03.885 --> 00:03:06.446
He probably got destroyed inside Groon by now."

53
00:03:08.127 --> 00:03:08.847
Roxy nodded.

54
00:03:08.867 --> 00:03:12.488
"He was practically falling apart when he escaped."

55
00:03:13.768 --> 00:03:14.688
Terrell smiled.

56
00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:19.570
"Good!" Cozlin looked out the window.

57
00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:24.091
"What will happen to Groon?"

58
00:03:24.511 --> 00:03:25.111
she asked.

59
00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:27.412
"Will it be destroyed?"

60
00:03:29.696 --> 00:03:31.237
"I wish I knew," Dr.

61
00:03:31.317 --> 00:03:31.857
Odd said.

62
00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:36.959
"But even if it is, at least the Groonians aren't stranded on it.

63
00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:39.300
They left long ago.

64
00:03:40.721 --> 00:03:43.021
I hope they're safe—wherever they are."

65
00:03:48.724 --> 00:03:51.225
the planet will be okay," Roxy said.

66
00:03:51.245 --> 00:03:58.808
"Look!" More chunks of metal and old machinery left Groon's surface, exposing spots of green.

67
00:04:01.056 --> 00:04:02.056
"Those are trees!"

68
00:04:02.477 --> 00:04:03.337
Wukong said.

69
00:04:05.058 --> 00:04:06.038
Dr. Odd nodded.

70
00:04:06.058 --> 00:04:10.800
"I believe Groon's forests will be able to restore themselves."

71
00:04:12.741 --> 00:04:14.182
Cozlin looked around at everyone.

72
00:04:14.202 --> 00:04:17.423
"I used to like working alone.

73
00:04:18.283 --> 00:04:20.104
But our team is pretty cool."

74
00:04:20.124 --> 00:04:22.625
"It sure is!"

75
00:04:23.085 --> 00:04:23.766
Terrell said.

76
00:04:23.786 --> 00:04:27.847
"What should we call ourselves?"

77
00:04:27.887 --> 00:04:29.128
Dr. Odd tapped his chin.

78
00:04:30.424 --> 00:04:32.845
"You should call yourselves the Galaxy Squad."

79
00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:34.806
"No, Dr.

80
00:04:34.987 --> 00:04:36.227
Odd," Roxy said.

81
00:04:36.247 --> 00:04:39.729
"We should call ourselves the Galaxy Squad.

82
00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.950
You're a part of this team."

83
00:04:43.271 --> 00:04:44.332
Dr. Odd smiled.

84
00:04:44.352 --> 00:04:48.954
"Now I'm a part of two teams," Wukong said.

85
00:04:48.974 --> 00:04:52.956
"I like my other team, but one member is really lazy.

86
00:04:54.537 --> 00:04:56.098
You guys all work pretty hard."

87
00:04:59.139 --> 00:05:01.129
Terrell gulped.

88
00:05:01.149 --> 00:05:02.312
"Our work isn't done."

89
00:05:03.756 --> 00:05:04.900
He pointed out the window.

90
00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.367
"Meltron wasn't destroyed.

91
00:05:07.909 --> 00:05:08.751
He's escaping!"
